    "summary": "As the opponent’s Shooting phase begins, you may have one of your army’s PSYKER models use Horrible Fascination. Choose an enemy unit the caster can see up to 12″ away and roll one D6. A 1 deals D3 mortal wounds to the caster. On 2–5 the target takes −1 on its Hit rolls for the phase. On 6 the enemy unit becomes ineligible to shoot for that phase.",
